---

### `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Python bytecode & caches
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Virtual environments
venv/
.venv/
env/
ENV/

# Large RL model weights & checkpoints (keep small final weights if under 25MB, otherwise ignore)
models/*.zip
models/*.pt
models/*.pth
models/*.onnx
*.tar
*.tar.gz

# Training logs, TensorBoard runs & rendered gameplay videos
logs/
runs/
tb_logs/
wandb/
videos/
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.avi
*.gif

# Secrets & local environment variables
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# IDE & OS clutter
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db